151	    // flips when `heartbeat_export_job` reports the job has been
152	    // reclaimed. Downstream code (the streaming writer and the final
153	    // rename) checks `lease_lost` to short-circuit its side effects
154	    // so a stale worker cannot publish a partial/bogus artifact over
155	    // the new owner's work.
